{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Love, Friendship &amp; Supernatural Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will Ash find the courage to confess their feelings, or will otherworldly chaos derail their plans?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Love is a Demon</i> is a narrative adventure game that takes you on a heartfelt and hilarious ride through the complexities of romance and personal growth. Step into the shoes of Ash, an introverted dreamer finally ready to confess their feelings to their best friend, Ivy. But just as everything seems to fall into place, an unforeseen supernatural event throws their world into disarray, and they have to embark on an unpredictable adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/c3438992ec824caffd8b2856cf8c695d.poster.avif?t=1769180427\" width=950 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/c3438992ec824caffd8b2856cf8c695d.webm?t=1769180427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/c3438992ec824caffd8b2856cf8c695d.mp4?t=1769180427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Humour &amp; Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy witty dialogue, quirky interactions, and absurd situations that make love feel messier than ever. Have you ever considered what doing dishes says about your relationship?\u00a0Solve puzzles that reflect the ups and downs of Ash\u2019s journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/d41f55d05309f69988260a80f4239495.poster.avif?t=1769180427\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/d41f55d05309f69988260a80f4239495.webm?t=1769180427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/d41f55d05309f69988260a80f4239495.mp4?t=1769180427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your hero</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three appearances for Ash. You can choose the one that you identify with the most.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choices &amp; Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions shape relationships, emotional outcomes, and determine the outcomes of this love story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes there\u2019s no <i>right</i> answer, only an honest one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/f5a19f330ce5f1334639e9c0d31f11d6.poster.avif?t=1769180427\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/f5a19f330ce5f1334639e9c0d31f11d6.webm?t=1769180427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/f5a19f330ce5f1334639e9c0d31f11d6.mp4?t=1769180427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Love interests</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ivy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019s a travel agent who never found her own place. Life spins faster, higher, and dangerously brighter when she\u2019s around, and there is no way to stop it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/7e2a6a39ef48e73dca9c1e1f37a2eaef.poster.avif?t=1769180427\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/7e2a6a39ef48e73dca9c1e1f37a2eaef.webm?t=1769180427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/7e2a6a39ef48e73dca9c1e1f37a2eaef.mp4?t=1769180427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Luna</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle spirit who grounds chaos with a single breath. Discipline, calmness, and kindness are her strengths, and under it lies a deeper connection to the world, as if she moves in tune with something unseen.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/dbe5e01741ad1fd3574e9ed07d0ec30a.poster.avif?t=1769180427\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/dbe5e01741ad1fd3574e9ed07d0ec30a.webm?t=1769180427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/dbe5e01741ad1fd3574e9ed07d0ec30a.mp4?t=1769180427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the Story</strong> \u2013 Explore Ash\u2019s world through immersive, interactive moments that pull you deeper into their journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the Narrative</strong> \u2013 Every choice you make influences Ash\u2019s relationships and leads to different outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humour &amp; Puzzles\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Enjoy witty dialogue, quirky interactions, and absurd situations that make love feel messier than ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Journey:</strong> Explore love, friendship, and self-discovery through relatable moments that resonate with your heart.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve &amp; Explore:</strong> Solve fun puzzles that reflect the ups and downs of Ash\u2019s journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your decisions shape Ash\u2019s path and determine the outcomes of their love story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Exploration:</strong> Build relationships, uncover backstories, and explore how each character\u2019s dynamics influence the journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices. Your love life. Your demonic mess.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/717f8649aaac51556d347b688d2993a3.avif?t=1769180427\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3530240?t=1769180427","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/4f6321068b07145814014109e89e4fd706457a9c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769180427","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/a25aabd5624ff9bf3019ad196e2b8d023b14c3bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769180427","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/a25aabd5624ff9bf3019ad196e2b8d023b14c3bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769180427","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":1