e9ed07d0ec30a.mp4?t=1769180427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live the Story</strong> \u2013 Explore Ash\u2019s world through immersive, interactive moments that pull you deeper into their journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the Narrative</strong> \u2013 Every choice you make influences Ash\u2019s relationships and leads to different outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humour &amp; Puzzles\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Enjoy witty dialogue, quirky interactions, and absurd situations that make love feel messier than ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Journey:</strong> Explore love, friendship, and self-discovery through relatable moments that resonate with your heart.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve &amp; Explore:</strong> Solve fun puzzles that reflect the ups and downs of Ash\u2019s journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your decisions shape Ash\u2019s path and determine the outcomes of their love story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Exploration:</strong> Build relationships, uncover backstories, and explore how each character\u2019s dynamics influence the journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices. Your love life. Your demonic mess.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530240/extras/717f8649aaac51556d347b688d2993a3.avif?t=1769180427\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Fantastic Humans"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite